      "estimated_duration_s": 15,
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B08.mp3",
      "narration_text": "One fix: a same-family judge — GPT-4 scoring GPT-4 — systematically over-rewards its own family's outputs. They share training data and stylistic preferences. The fix is a judge from a different lineage than the generator.",
