      "estimated_duration_s": 16,
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B09.mp3",
      "narration_text": "Every production pipeline needs a calibration set — one hundred to five hundred human-labeled examples. Teams re-run the judge against it monthly, tracking agreement. When agreement drops below seventy-five percent, that triggers recalibration.",
